{'symbol': 'TRMB', 'date': '2022-03-22 07:30:00', 'title': 'QUALCOMM AND TRIMBLE INTRODUCE METER-LEVEL LOCATION ACCURACY FOR SMARTPHONES', 'text': 'TRIMBLE RTX TECHNOLOGY TO WORK WITH PREMIUM SNAPDRAGON \xa0MOBILE PLATFORMS FOR\xa0 ENHANCED SMARTPHONE LOCATION-BASED APPLICATIONS INCLUDING LANE-LEVEL NAVIGATION SUNNYVALE, CALIF. AND SAN DIEGO , MARCH 22, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TRIMBLE (NASDAQ: TRMB) AND QUALCOMM TECHNOLOGIES, INC. ANNOUNCED TODAY THE AVAILABILITY OF TRIMBLE\xa0RTX® GNSS TECHNOLOGY FOR SNAPDRAGON® 8 GEN 1 AND SNAPDRAGON 888 MOBILE PLATFORMS.'}